@base = http://localhost:8083
@user = alice
@password = demo-pass

### Current identity
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}

### Main workflow action
POST {{base}}/api/ask
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is required for expense reimbursement?"
}

### Health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health
